{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块保留了处境、原因和反应之间的关系，单看大字也更容易串成完整的心理变化；X 的重点较多是孤立的关键词。small：X 的补充相对收敛，Y 有不少小块重复大字已经表达的意思，部分旁注也增加了信息拥挤感。core、concise：X 更稳地围绕亲密带来的幸福与留不住它的痛楚展开，Y 在 S07 等处引入情欲、执念等内容，容易偏离核心，而且同屏及跨屏的感受重复较多。human：X 的叙述衔接更自然；Y 的「不再装完整」「情欲、执念和对生命的眷恋一齐翻涌」等表达有明显的生硬、摘要腔或名词堆叠感。fine：Y 的身体感受和生活化体验更直接具体，例如夏末潮湿温热的风、白天相处很好而回家后心里发酸；X 有些感受转成了对声部、歌声和音乐变化的描述。load：Y 每屏大块数量较少，意群也比较完整，停留时间足以扫读；小字虽然多，但字号层级明确。综合而言，X 在核心表达、语言自然度和信息克制上更有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2be7482d-203e-4e9d-b37b-5ea3ae9380a0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T204944598039Z", "elapsed_seconds": 166.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T20:52:31.393998+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1200ed014ccd4e1d7064f0d10ba37627bdf1ae882f47931cce473384d281618", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a